<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75461" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρφν-ῐνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρφνός, ὄ. χρῶμα</span>
			 a <i>brownish grey</i> colour, being mixed of black, red,
			and white (but with most black), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				68c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Duris
				31
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i> ; put by <i><span class="en">
				X.
			</span></i> between <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορφύρεος</span> and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοινίκινος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.3.3
			</span></i>:—the form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρφνιος</span></b>  occurs in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Col.</u>
				792a27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				794b5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.565c
			</span></i>, but is prob. corrupt.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
